From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] mfbt, mozglue, NSPR, XPCOM, IPC: 32-bit ARM Windows in an app
 container

The platform layer where the desktop API is missing or different in a UWP
app: stack walking and interception on ARM32, the Windows version checks,
thread naming, COM runtime set-up, file associations and the startup cache
in the app's own folders.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
